# No addresses yet: review falls through to ../../OWNERS. See that file.
#
# This directory parses bytes an untrusted party wrote, which is the reason it
# runs in a sandbox at all. Two properties are held by hand here and nowhere
# else, and both need a second reader:
#
#   media_tool_service.cc  Admit() is the only gate. Everything it refuses is
#                          authority this process would otherwise hold.
#   media_probe.cc         the reading carries numbers and never a string, so
#                          no container-controlled value crosses back.
per-file media_tool_service*=file://ipc/SECURITY_OWNERS
per-file media_probe*=file://ipc/SECURITY_OWNERS
